{"id":"658811","name":"青团","author":"丽彩（五谷杂粮）","authorId":"12357987","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/658811/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"糯米粉","amount":"400克"},{"name":"澄面","amount":"120克"},{"name":"肉沫豆干酸菜馅","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"艾草泥","amount":"400克"},{"name":"开水","amount":"200克"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"新鲜的艾草焯水放入破壁机里面打成泥。","img":"images/658811/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"克糯米粉，加入40克黄油，20克白糖。","img":"images/658811/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"抓拌均匀。","img":"images/658811/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加入大约400克的艾草泥。","img":"images/658811/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"揉成团。","img":"images/658811/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"另取一个盆放入澄面120克。","img":"images/658811/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"倒入200克沸水。","img":"images/658811/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"搅和成团。","img":"images/658811/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入艾米团中。","img":"images/658811/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"继续揉成团。","img":"images/658811/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"内馅可以是芋泥馅，咸蛋黄肉松馅，我这次用肉沫豆干酸菜馅。","img":"images/658811/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"取40克左右的面皮包裹上适量的馅。","img":"images/658811/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"收口。","img":"images/658811/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"水开后再上锅蒸8分钟。","img":"images/658811/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"出锅后表面喷一层食用油。","img":"images/658811/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：料理机、蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}